WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.544
Kinkirsi'en, ruuhuuji nder ladde.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.362
Mawɓe ɗon mbi'a: "To a wurti nder gariiri saabe nyalawma, a waawataa yahugo bee hoore ma nder ladde".

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.360
Kinkirsi'en njooɗoto nder nokkuure nde, feere-feere ɓe mbaɗi dow dabbaaji ladde.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.888
Ɓe mbi'i ɗum kinkirga.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:35.488
E wiyde aada mossi nde anndudi biyeteeɗo Doris Bonnet hollitii, yimɓe ɓe'e ngoni nder kuuje, koo go'o e innde hooreejo maɓɓe.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.618
Ɓe ngiɗi nyaamdu: njuumre, seeseem, cakkitiiɗe njayri e geɗal.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:53.984
Yimɓe ɓeen boo mbi'i ɗi ɗon wara e ɓikkoy, haa teeŋti e ɓerɗe ɓerɗi, ngam nder nguurndam maɓɓe fuu ɓe laatoo ɓerdiiɓe ruuhu.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.976
Woɗɓe nder maɓɓe ɗon njaha ngam ɓe mbi'a.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:13.436
Ɗuum ɗemngal hollitii baylitol ngol. Haa jooni, o meeɗaa anndude ko Kaya waɗi: o waawi jaɓugo ɗum to gooduɗo haala leydi ndii.
